Design boundary: the literal R[T]-subalgebra generated by p=x*t and
q=x*(p+2), with T acting by t=y+x^3+x^2+1, is finite when two is a unit.
Named downstream consumer: identifying the actual single-section affine
complement and constructing full FiniteMapData. Free rank three and the
scheme identification are separate obligations, not asserted here.
